    {
      "line": 34,
      "text": "活动规则：",
      "type": "rules-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        34
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "text": "1. 由玩家自由组队，队伍中角色之间的最大等级差不得超过15级，相同职业数量不得超过1个。",
      "type": "party-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        35
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "text": "2. 组满5人后，玩家可寻找场内的天梯管理员进行匹配。若匹配、战斗过程中出现队友离队的情况，可重新进行组队。",
      "type": "party-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        36
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "text": "3. 对战的对手由系统根据双方的队伍等级、历史战绩、战斗力等因素进行随机匹配，优先匹配实力最接近的对手。",
      "type": "matchmaking-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        37
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "text": "4. 匹配完成后，等待数秒将会自动进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-start",
      "sourceLines": [
        38
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "text": "匹配结束前如遇队员掉线、离队情况，视作取消匹配，不会影响您的活动次数和天梯积分。",
      "type": "cancellation-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        39
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "text": "比赛规则：",
      "type": "battle-rules-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        40
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 41,
      "text": "1. 人物将不会因为受到伤害导致被击飞。",
      "type": "no-knockout-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        41
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 42,
      "text": "2. 若有玩家在战斗中出现掉线、登出等情况，一律视为该玩家战斗失败，扣除对应的天梯积分且不会获得任何奖励。",
      "type": "disconnect-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        42
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 43,
      "text": "该结果仅影响发生掉线的玩家，不会影响到队友。",
      "type": "disconnect-scope",
      "sourceLines": [
        43
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 44,
      "text": "3. 本着保持速战速决的原则。",
      "type": "round-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        44
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 45,
      "text": "比赛超过29回合时，系统将以第29回合结束时场上剩余站立角色的数量多寡来判定胜负，",
      "type": "round-limit-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        45
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 46,
      "text": "若双方站立角色数相等，则进入“黄金一击”模式：任何一方如有角色率先被击倒，则判定该队失败；",
      "type": "sudden-death-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        46
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
